flag any video doing 3x the channel's median as an outlier with one line on why the title or thumbnail works.

178
00:15:05,262 --> 00:15:14,752
Done equals tracker updated outliers flagged, stop after eight runs, and then I can do forward slash loop and state the interval that I would like this task to complete.

